  1773	def _is_ssh_signed(root, sha):
  1774	    """True iff <sha>'s signature is an SSH signature (vs GPG). The project
  1775	    signer policy is an ssh allowed_signers file, which git only consults for SSH
  1776	    signatures — a GPG-signed commit would be validated against the ambient GPG
  1777	    keyring and bypass the policy entirely (GLM R4 P2-2).
