  2312	def cmd_check(args):
  2313	    """The one-command boundary: derive the floor, run the tests, run the
  2314	    reviewers the tier requires, record it all bound to HEAD, then gate.
  2315	
  2316	    Prints ONE line on success ("SAFE TO MERGE") and ONE concrete reason on
