  1731	# git's %G? signature-status codes. Only "G" (good AND from a key of sufficient
  1732	# validity — gpg owner-trust, or an ssh signer in allowed_signers) proves an
  1733	# AUTHORIZED author. "U" is a good signature whose key validity is UNKNOWN (e.g.
